t-tangent identity as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sec}⁡x(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+1)-{tan}^{2}⁡x & ={sec}^{2}⁡x+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-{tan}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =1+{tan}^{2}⁡x+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-{tan}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =1+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sec}⁡x(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+1)-{tan}^{2}⁡x=1+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039367/state.json" "file_sha256" "1a0251ede3323a692c69fc666221a7a4706396575650c6f4421a0566dc7c57bd"} {"question" "q-142820" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039367/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0798ece5d0a2d260a2cf373eb2ea5bd6dc4b3fe91cf175ef36215808cc370b63"} {"question" "q-142820" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039367/state.json" "file_sha256" "1a0251ede3323a692c69fc666221a7a4706396575650c6f4421a0566dc7c57bd"} {"question" "q-142820" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "1+2\\operatorname{sec}⁡x"] ["math" "1+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x"] ["math" "1-{sec}^{2}⁡x"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sec}⁡x"] ["math" "{sec}^{2}⁡x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039367/state.json" "file_sha256" "1a0251ede3323a692c69fc666221a7a4706396575650c6f4421a0566dc7c57bd"} {"question" "q-142820" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039367/state.json" "file_sha256" "1a0251ed